# Build context exclusions.
#
# The first entry is load-bearing, not just an optimisation: `COPY . /app` followed by `yarn build`
# would copy public/data into dist/, so on any machine where `yarn fetch-data` has been run the
# ~16MB ontology would be silently baked into the image — the thing the entrypoint fetch exists to
# avoid, and a build whose output depends on local developer state.
public/data/

# Stray full-size copies of the same ontology.
npo-merged.jsonld
cellcard-spec/*.jsonld

# Reinstalled inside the image by `yarn install`; sending it is slow and can leak host-native
# binaries into a different base image.
node_modules/
dist/

.git/
.github/
.vscode/
.idea/
.claude/

# Vendored vanilla-JS app, not part of the Vite build.
nervosensus/

# Separate Puppeteer/Jest package with its own node_modules.
test/

# Secrets and local overrides — the image gets its .env written from build args.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

*.log
.DS_Store
